    "flow_code": "float Magnitude = Flow.x * MaxVelocity;\r\nfloat Direction = Flow.y * 2 * PI;\r\n\r\nfloat FlowX = Magnitude * cos(Direction);\r\nfloat FlowY = Magnitude * sin(Direction);\r\n\r\nfloat NormalizedFlowX = (FlowX / (2 * MaxVelocity)) + 0.5;\r\nfloat NormalizedFlowY = (FlowY / (2 * MaxVelocity)) + 0.5;\r\n\r\nreturn float2(NormalizedFlowX, NormalizedFlowY);",
    "default_maximum_velocity": 1024.0,
    "order": "VertexColor RG -> polar-to-Cartesian custom -> append UV -> VertexInterpolator -> emissive"
  },
